Package: validationcheck
Title: Interactive Data Validation Framework for Monitoring and Evaluation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
      "Roy",
      "Mwavita",
      email = "lennicroy@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: 
    validationcheck is an interactive data quality and validation 
    framework designed for Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability, 
    and Learning (MEAL) systems. The package allows users to run 
    validation checks, identify data quality issues, generate 
    interactive validation reports, and extract failed records.
